# never forgets it). Delete the folder and re-run that script to restore.
Sound Demos/

# Vox plugin build output — 148 MB of compiled artefacts (object files, a
# 27 MB juceaide binary, a 24 MB static library). Owner 2026-09-02: the Vox
# plugin is a separate project that landed here by accident. Build output is
# regenerated by cmake/ninja from vox_plugin/Source and JUCE, so nothing is
# lost by keeping it out of git. The files STAY on disk — this only stops
# git tracking them.
vox_plugin/build/

